        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2073]\nWhen the EVCC wants to resume the previously paused V2G communication session, the EVCC shall follow 7.7.3.3, 7.7.3.4 and 7.7.3.5 to set up a new TLS session that can be used for V2G session resumption.",
